WEBVTT

00:09:26.836 --> 00:09:30.116
And the finance sector
has a critical role to play.

00:09:30.676 --> 00:09:32.476
But we need to do it in a way

00:09:32.516 --> 00:09:37.716
that is focused on serious
science-based solutions --

00:09:37.756 --> 00:09:40.716
not just in our investment portfolios

00:09:40.716 --> 00:09:43.236
but out there in the real world.

00:09:44.156 --> 00:09:45.316
Thank you.

00:09:45.356 --> 00:09:49.116
(Applause)